window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"sylas","b":"masteryi","win":["Sylas","Sylas","Sylas","Sylas","Master Yi","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Chain Lash poke and your early defences out-trade his empty kit — bully immediately."},{"when":"Level 3","text":"Abduct pull into your full combo out-pressures him; Alpha Strike is 20s."},{"when":"Yi level 6","text":"Highlander is 85s and makes him immune to slows — your Q can no longer buy you distance."},{"when":"Yi two-plus items","text":"His shred and resets out-duel you solo — fight him only with your team."}],"wants":{"you":["Farm denied through the early levels","Hijack saved for Highlander","Fights taken with allies nearby"],"foe":["Quiet scaling into his 6","Your burst dodged inside Alpha Strike","Isolated targets late for reset chains"]},"early":"You bully him for four straight stages: Chain Lash poke and your early defences out-trade his empty level-1 kit, E poke and W sustain deny his farm at 2, and the Abduct pull into your full combo out-pressures him from 3 on. His only out is Alpha Strike, 20s and untargetable mid-dash — bait it, then commit.","mid":"At 6 the matchup turns: Highlander is 85s, makes him slow-immune, and out-DPSes your burst the moment you misstep. Buy Grievous Wounds before his first item — Meditate is a 10s channel that refunds the whole trade. Your trump card is Hijacking Highlander; a Sylas holding his own steroid flips the duel back.","late":"At two-plus items his shred and reset chains out-duel you solo, so stop soloing. Group, open fights by stealing the scariest ult on his team — often his — and burst him down inside your allies' CC before the resets start. Your mid-game lead should already have decided the map by now.","whys":["Your Chain Lash poke and early defences out-trade his level-1 kit.","At 2 your E poke and W sustain keep denying his farm.","Level 3 your Abduct pull and combo still out-pressure him.","Through 4-5 your burst beats him; Meditate is his one answer, on 10s.","At 6 Highlander is an 85s steroid that makes him slow-immune — your Q slow stops mattering.","First item is a race: Wuju Style is true damage, so MR does not slow him down.","At 2+ items his shred and resets out-duel you in a solo fight — group and steal his steroid."]});
